.TH SETDOMAINNAME 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
setdomainname \- sets the nis domain name of the calling uts namespace; requires cap_sys_admin in its user namespace
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <unistd.h>
.B int setdomainname(const char* name, size_t length);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Sets the NIS domain name of the calling UTS namespace; requires CAP_SYS_ADMIN in its user namespace.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR setdomainname (2)
